To enable the searchbar, add the following to your docusaurus config file:

```js
export default {
  themes: ['@upstash/docusaurus-theme-upstash-search'],
  // ...
  themeConfig: {
    // ...
    upstash: {
      upstashSearchRestUrl: "UPSTASH_SEARCH_REST_URL",
