### Perform Sparse Vector Operations in JavaScript

Source: https://upstash.com/docs/vector/overall/llms-txt

Demonstrates upserting sparse vectors and querying using IDF weighting, as well as text-based upsert and query operations.

```javascript
import { Index, WeightingStrategy } from "@upstash/vector";

const index = new Index({
  url: process.env.UPSTASH_VECTOR_REST_URL,
  token: process.env.UPSTASH_VECTOR_REST_TOKEN,
});

await index.upsert([
  {
    id: "sparse-1",
    sparseVector: {
      indices: [1, 42, 1523, 5000],
      values: [0.3, 0.8, 0.5, 0.2]
    }
  }
]);

