### Resumable Querying

Source: https://upstash.com/docs/vector/sdk/gosdk

Performs paginated queries across different index types using a handle that must be closed to release resources.

```go
scores, handle, err := index.ResumableQuery(vector.ResumableQuery{
	Vector:          []float32{0.0, 1.0},
	TopK:            2,
	IncludeVectors:  false,
	IncludeMetadata: false,
	IncludeData:     false,
})
defer handle.Close()

scores, err = handle.Next(vector.ResumableQueryNext{
	AdditionalK: 3,
})

scores, err = handle.Next(vector.ResumableQueryNext{
	AdditionalK: 5,
})
```

