Source: https://upstash.com/docs/workflow/howto/middlewares

Create a custom WorkflowMiddleware to track errors and send them to an external monitoring service. Ensure the monitoring service endpoint and request body are correctly configured.

```typescript
import { WorkflowMiddleware } from "@upstash/workflow";

const errorTrackingMiddleware = new WorkflowMiddleware({
  name: "error-tracking",
  callbacks: {
    onError: async ({ workflowRunId, error }) => {
      await fetch("https://your-monitoring-service.com/errors", {
        method: "POST",
        headers: { "Content-Type": "application/json" },
        body: JSON.stringify({
          workflowRunId,
          error: error.message,
          stack: error.stack,
          timestamp: new Date().toISOString()
        })
      });
    }
  }
});
```

