### Wrap Non-idempotent Code in context.run

Source: https://upstash.com/docs/workflow/basics/caveats

Correct implementation to handle non-idempotent operations by wrapping them in context.run.

```typescript
const result = await context.run(async () => {
  await getResultFromDb(entryId)
});
if (result.return) {
  return;
}
```

